computing/README

This is the source for *Theory of Computing* by Jim Hefferon. 

This source uses LaTeX and related programs.  To install the source
files, see INSTALL.

CONTACT

  jhefferon@smcvt.edu

STATUS

This is a draft.  I am using it for the first time in a class.  It
is complete in that all the chapters are there, and all the sections,
along with exercises.  But you should expect errors.

In particular, it is my intention to supplement the text with
programming exercises.  For this I had in mind using Chicken Scheme or
Racket.  (But Python is not impossible.)  That material is not written.


